    "intro_title": {
        "ja": "まち歩きマップメーカーで地図を作ってみましょう",
        "en": "Create a map with Walking Map Maker"
    },
    "intro_message": {
        "ja": "場所を検索してズームし、「マップを作る」を押すと、自由に加工・印刷できる地図画像を作成できます。画面下部のボタンが見えない場合は、ChromeやSafariなどで開いてください。",
        "en": "Search for a place, zoom in, and select “Create Map” to make a map image you can freely edit and print. If the buttons at the bottom of the screen are hidden, open this page in Chrome or Safari."
    },
    "intro_close": {
        "ja": "案内を閉じる",
        "en": "Close introduction"
    },
    "licence": {
        "ja": "(利用規約)",
        "en": "(Terms of Use)"
    },
    "licence_title": {
        "ja": "地図の利用規約",
        "en": "Terms of Use for Maps"
    },
    "licence_message": {
        "ja": "地図は <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/deed.ja\" target='_blank'>CC BY 4.0</a> ライセンスで提供します。<br>簡単に書くと、以下の条件を守る限り商用も含めて自由に使えます。<br><ul class='mt-3'><li>表示:「© OpenStreetMap」を地図の何処かに表示すること</li></li></ul>上記の条件を守れば、商用利用も含めて自由に使えます。<br>なお、マップ作成時のURLのみをログに記録しています。",
        "en": "Maps are provided under a <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\" target='_blank'>CC BY 4.0</a> license.<br>In brief, you can use it freely, including for commercial purposes, as long as you keep the following conditions.<br><ul class='mt-3'><li>View: place \"© OpenStreetMap\" somewhere on the map crisis</li></ul>You can use it freely, including commercial use, as long as you comply with the above conditions.<br>Only the URL at the time of map creation is logged."
    },
    "more_message": {
        "ja": "<hr>道路や建物が無い時は<a href=\"https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/JA:%E5%88%9D%E5%BF%83%E8%80%85%E3%82%AC%E3%82%A4%E3%83%89\" target='_blank'>OpenStreetMapを編集</a>してみてください。<br>描いた地図は様々に活用され将来に残ります。",
        "en": "<hr>If you don't have a road or a building, <a href=\"https://wiki.openstreetmap.org/wiki/Beginners%27_guide\" target='_blank'>you can edit OpenStreetMap</a>.<br>Your edited map will be used for many activities and will be preserved for future use."
    },
